            <title>[BOOKKEEPER-600] shouldClaim flag isn&apos;t cleared for hedwig multiplex java client</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/BOOKKEEPER-600</link>
                <project id="12311293" key="BOOKKEEPER">Bookkeeper</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;shouldClaim flag isn&apos;t cleared when resubscribing in multiplex java client. so it would continue claiming topic ownership in one hub, which is bad for load balancing.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
